<td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><kbd>ATTGCCATAGCTGGTGGTTTTCA</kbd></td>
<td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Amplification of the <em>gbpA</em> upstream region</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">    GBPA05-R</td>
<td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><kbd>CCCCGCTATCTTGGGTATGGTAAAAA</kbd></td>
<td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Amplification of the <em>gbpA</em> upstream region, Extension of the <em>gbpA</em> transcript</td>
</tr>
