</div></div></section><section id="fn-group2" class="fn-group"><div class="fn-group p font-secondary-light font-sm"><div class="fn p" id="FN2">
<sup>2</sup><div class="display-inline p">The abbreviations used are:
<dl class="def-list">
<dt id="G1">CRP</dt>
<dd><div class="p">cyclic AMP receptor protein</div></dd>
<dt id="G2">MTX</dt>
<dd><div class="p">methotrexate</div></dd>
<dt id="G3">qRT-PCR</dt>
<dd><div class="p">quantitative real time PCR</div></dd>
<dt id="G4">EMSA</dt>
<dd><div class="p">electrophoretic mobility shift assay</div></dd>
<dt id="G5">RLU</dt>
<dd><div class="p">relative light unit</div></dd>
<dt id="G6">F</dt>
<dd><div class="p">forward</div></dd>
<dt id="G7">R</dt>
<dd><div class="p">reverse.</div></dd>
